# Glacier Station's ice cave (CIPlay glacier_station_cave; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe (11-17 w15):
# a knoll on the shore (hw_mount, heart -73.7 84.75, b 12), a level adit dug from the shelf at -62 78 (2.5 m; yaw 300: way
# in = -x +z; 3 m flat, 8 m on, the room 11-16 m in); the sign gsicesign at -55 72; a brown bear (gsbear) waits in the room
# (creature.zone gs_wake 5 m in; the queen is a Polar Bear: 'kill Bear' leaves her); the chest "Supply cache 3" at -74.7 87;
# zone gs_icecave at -69.8 82.5. In-cave pictures at absolute heights.
island Glacier Station keep
offset -0.3671 0.4314
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
picture gs_ice_out -53.3 +3 73 -62 +1.5 78
read SUPPLY CACHE 3

# The bear in the cache (11-12 mixed monsters) waits in the room until the player is in the adit
wait 3
walk -56.8 75 to -62 78 to -66.3 80.5
wait 3
expect animals Bear 1
expect animalsinside Bear 1
kill Bear
expect animals Bear 0

walk -66.3 80.5 to -69.8 82.5
zone gs_icecave
picture gs_ice_in -68.1 3.0 81.5 -74.5 2.0 85.2 light=20
walk -69.8 82.5 to -73.7 84.75 to -74.6 86.2
open Supply cache 3
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
walk -74.6 86.2 to -73.7 84.75 to -69.8 82.5 to -66.3 80.5 to -62 78 to -56.8 75
